+    /**
+     * Localized nav label. Engines register header items with hardcoded English
+     * titles (Fleet-Ops, Storefront, Products, ...); slugify the title and look
+     * it up under `header-nav.<slug>` then `nav-card-title.<slug>` so both
+     * extension titles and pinned shortcuts follow the active locale. Falls
+     * back to the raw title when no translation exists. Never mutate the
+     * registered item — the universe registry is a singleton and a mutated
+     * title sticks across locale switches.
